ctrREG M.CPR [11:0]


Number of Pole Pairs Setting



KTM5900 allows multiple pole pairs signals, such as the magnetic grating
shown in Figure ?? or the optical encoder signal shown in Figure ??, to be
converted into absolute angles for one mechanical cycle or one rotation. ctrREG
The number of pole pairs can be easily set by configuring the M.CPR

