actual number of pole pairs. For example, if a customer is using a 32 pole ctrREG
pair magnet, the M.CPR should be set to 31. When the analog signal

from the optical encoder is input to KTM5900, KTM5900 will output the
corresponding angle from 0-360° for one rotation of the optical encoder.



