## 8 Filter Module (F)


KTM5900 incorporates a dedicated low-pass filter capable of operating in fixed bandwidth
and adaptive dynamic modes, used for real-time processing of angle and velocity data.
This filter enables users to obtain smoother and more accurate measurements of angle and
velocity.


